stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> investigator
  investigator --> tools: tool calls requested, within budget
  investigator --> triage: done, cost cap, or no tool calls
  tools --> investigator: within budget
  tools --> triage: step cap reached
  triage --> rca
  rca --> request_approval: guardrails applied<br/>status AWAITING_APPROVAL
  request_approval --> approval: proposal registered in Sentinel Guard<br/>(not for escalate, guard down → recorded error)
  approval --> execute: approved action (REMEDIATING)
  approval --> postmortem: rejected or escalate
  execute --> verify: capability from the guard, executed once
  execute --> postmortem: not approved in the guard, guard down,<br/>refused capability, adapter error
  verify --> postmortem: RESOLVED or REMEDIATION_FAILED
  postmortem --> [*]
  note right of approval
    Graph pauses here.
    State is checkpointed in Postgres;
    any replica can resume hours later.
  end note
